1. THE THREE SHAPES, AT PEAK AMPLITUDE delta = 1.0
====================================================================================================
Same peak for all three, so the sweep varies SHAPE at fixed amplitude. What
differs is how much of the injected signal lands on days T3 labels positive.

  horizon h=15, build-up L=75
  shape        peak   mean on positive days   days carrying signal   of which labelled NEG
