  ramp        1.000                  0.9067                    450                     360
  ar1drift    1.000                  0.9147                    450                     360

  horizon h=75, build-up L=75
  shape        peak   mean on positive days   days carrying signal   of which labelled NEG
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  step        1.000                  1.0000                    450                       0
  ramp        1.000                  0.5067                    450                       0
  ar1drift    1.000                  0.5235                    450                       0

  This table is the whole mechanism. At h=15 the step puts its full
  amplitude on every labelled day and nothing anywhere else. The ramp
  and the drift put most of their signal on days T3 labels NEGATIVE,
  which pushes the AUC DOWN, not up.

